    "notes": "Professional director and former public servant. Chair of MetService (NZ-SOE-004) board since Jul 2022. Independent Non-Executive Director of Kordia Group since Apr 2023. Chair of Finance Risk & Assurance Committee at Greater Wellington Regional Council. Over 36 years in NZ public service including roles as Controller and Auditor-General (briefly in 2017), Secretary for Transport (2008-2016), and CE of Ministry for Culture and Heritage (1998-2008). BA (Hons) Economics and Accountancy from University of Otago. FCA of Chartered Accountants ANZ.",
